  "description": "A Coast Guard aircrew from Air Station Astoria, Ore., medically evacuates two fishermen from a commercial vessel in the Pacific Ocean about 14 nautical miles southwest of the Columbia River, Aug. 5, 2013. Watchstanders at Coast Guard Sector Columbia River, in Warrenton, Ore., dispatched an aircrew aboard an MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter after receiving the report of injured crewmembers from the captain of the vessel. U.S. Coast Guard video. Available in high definition.",
